Template 1914394 mapped_rxn: ... product is [F:1][CH:2]1[CH2:3][N:4]... etc. Precursors list: [['Cl[CH2:10][Cl:11]', '[F:1][CH:2]1[CH2:3][N:4]...']]. So product is something with fluorine etc. Not sure.

